{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17898","headline":"白二十二侍郎有双鹤留在洛下予西园多野水长松可以栖息遂以诗请之 · 裴度","name":"白二十二侍郎有双鹤留在洛下予西园多野水长松可以栖息遂以诗请之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君有双鹤，羁旅洛城东。\n未放归仙去，何如乞老翁。\n且将临野水，莫闭在樊笼。\n好是长鸣处，西园白露中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}